 going to see!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1346:b003:l013","ordinal":178968,"en":"Karmasharin Kakanchyn,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1346:b003:l014","ordinal":178969,"en":"God knows the dead"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1346:b003:l015","ordinal":178970,"en":"God knows they came"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1346:b003:l016","ordinal":178971,"en":"You are going to die!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1346:b003:l017","ordinal":178972,"en":"You start a trip to Beijing."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1346:b003:l018","ordinal":178973,"en":"Argyn, Kyrgyz people are thick"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1346:b003:l019","ordinal":178974,"en":"You left your village desolate!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1346:b003:l020","ordinal":178975,"en":"Beijing is a better place,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1346:b003:l021","ordinal":178976,"en":"No one has seen from afar,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1346:b003:l022","ordinal":178977,"en":"To a person who is not in a hurry"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1346:b003:l023","ordinal":178978,"en":"Six months is a long way."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1346:b003:l024","ordinal":178979,"en":"If it goes around, it's Greater Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1346:b003:l025","ordinal":178980,"en":"There is a lake where you can walk."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1346:b003:l026","ordinal":178981,"en":"Sometimes if it goes right"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1346:b003:l027","ordinal":178982,"en":"There is a desert of forty days."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1346:b003:l028","ordinal":178983,"en":"Beijing is not a cheap place."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1346:b003:l029","ordinal":178984,"en":"The receiver of moaning"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1346:b003:l030","ordinal":178985,"en":"Not the people of Anjiyan."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1346:b003:l031","ordinal":178986,"en":"I was seen having fun,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1346:b003:l032","ordinal":178987,"en":"Go in peace and stay safe,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1346:b003:l033","ordinal":178988,"en":"Don't come here soon!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1346:b003:l034","ordinal":178989,"en