he stone,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b003:l001","ordinal":179034,"en":"Its stock had broken apart."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b003:l002","ordinal":179035,"en":"Poor Bölökbay,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b003:l003","ordinal":179036,"en":"I repaired its stock again,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b003:l004","ordinal":179037,"en":"So the prince might shoot far,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b003:l005","ordinal":179038,"en":"So his enemy in combat"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b003:l006","ordinal":179039,"en":"Might lie utterly ruined."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b003:l007","ordinal":179040,"en":"I twisted it twelve times,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b003:l008","ordinal":179041,"en":"And repaired it to be just like"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b003:l009","ordinal":179042,"en":"Butcher King Manas's gun."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b003:l010","ordinal":179043,"en":"So Kongurbay, khan of Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b003:l011","ordinal":179044,"en":"Might stand and face him,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b003:l012","ordinal":179045,"en":"So he might carefully pull its trigger"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b003:l013","ordinal":179046,"en":"And strike the warrior firmly,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b003:l014","ordinal":179047,"en":"So it might wreak havoc"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b003:l015","ordinal":179048,"en":"Among the teeming Chinese,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b003:l016","ordinal":179049,"en":"So if my sultan enters battle"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b003:l017","ordinal":179050,"en":"He might take the ancient vengeance"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b003:l018","ordinal":179051,"en":"Of his royal father Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b003:l019","ordinal":179052,"en":"So when he aims it at the enemy,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b003:l020","ordinal":179053,"en":"Its bullet might roar away,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b003:l021","ordinal":179054,"en":"And tear through the head"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b003:l022","ordinal":1