 is what I have prepared for you."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l005","ordinal":179077,"en":"Listen, honored sons!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l006","ordinal":179078,"en":"There will be no regret when you fire them,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l007","ordinal":179079,"en":"If you unleash great conflict upon the khan."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l008","ordinal":179080,"en":"I knew from the beginning"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l009","ordinal":179081,"en":"That you would go to teeming China;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l010","ordinal":179082,"en":"I always thought you would go."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l011","ordinal":179083,"en":"How could things be right if you did not?"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l012","ordinal":179084,"en":"If you did not go to Beijing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l013","ordinal":179085,"en":"I thought my departed King Manas"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l014","ordinal":179086,"en":"Would be as though buried in salt."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l015","ordinal":179087,"en":"So I kept these prepared."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l016","ordinal":179088,"en":"I prepared twelve identical sharp guns,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l017","ordinal":179089,"en":"So you might fire in encirclement,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l018","ordinal":179090,"en":"And be filled with joy."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l019","ordinal":179091,"en":"Preparing all their powder and shot,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l020","ordinal":179092,"en":"I gathered forty Kalmyks,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l021","ordinal":179093,"en":"Without letting one person notice,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l022","ordinal":179094,"en":"Without letting anyone know,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l023","ordinal":179095,"en":"And had this wonder made."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l024","ordinal":179096,"en":"I had earth dug and saltpeter"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l025","ordinal":179097,"en":"Boiled without cease for seven years;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l026","ordinal":179098,"en":"I cast bullets from lead"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l027","ordinal":179099,"en":"And had the weapons made ready."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l028","ordinal":179100,"en":"I poured and boxed the powder"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l029","ordinal":179101,"en":"And had this wonder fashioned."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l030","ordinal":179102,"en":"For the twelve sharp guns,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l031","ordinal":179103,"en":"I had all the cast bullets"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l032","ordinal":179104,"en":"Divided into twelve separate lots."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l033","ordinal":179105,"en":"For all those bullets together,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l034","ordinal":179106,"en":"I had rawhide saddlebags made"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l035","ordinal":179107,"en":"And filled them with shot and powder."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l036","ordinal":179108,"en":"Such is the nature of a campaign:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l037","ordinal":179109,"en":"No man goes to teeming Beijing"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l038","ordinal":179110,"en":"Without making preparation."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1347:b005:l039","ordinal":179111,"en":"This arduous wonder I have made—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l001","ordinal":179112,"en":"My dear sons, listen!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l002","ordinal":179113,"en":"When you face them, fire,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l003","ordinal":179114,"en":"And go on campaign to Beijing;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l004","ordinal":179115,"en":"Remember me then"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l005","ordinal":179116,"en":"As your lame ritual father!”"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l006","ordinal":179117,"en":"Thus Bölökbay finished"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l007","ordinal":179118,"en":"The warrior's speech."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l008","ordinal":179119,"en":"Treasurer Bölökbay,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l009","ordinal":179120,"en":"Ah, your dear ritual father!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l010","ordinal":179121,"en":"Within the treasury itself,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l011","ordinal":179122,"en":"At the side of the exit door,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l012","ordinal":179123,"en":"Were five guest palaces,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l013","ordinal":179124,"en":"Built exceedingly strong."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l014","ordinal":179125,"en":"To the mouth of that treasury"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l015","ordinal":179126,"en":"No man not fated to die went;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l016","ordinal":179127,"en":"Whoever entered without care"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l017","ordinal":179128,"en":"Never escaped suffering."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l018","ordinal":179129,"en":"At the treasury entrance stood"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l019","ordinal":179130,"en":"Poor Khan Bölökbay's"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l020","ordinal":179131,"en":"Champion guards."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l021","ordinal":179132,"en":"With saddlebags full of bullets,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l022","ordinal":179133,"en":"Their knees bending to the ground,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l023","ordinal":179134,"en":"Many champions lifted them."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l024","ordinal":179135,"en":"They ran carrying twelve saddlebags"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l025","ordinal":179136,"en":"Of bullets and powder,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l026","ordinal":179137,"en":"And entrusted them"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l027","ordinal":179138,"en":"To the prince, the butcher's son."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l028","ordinal":179139,"en":"After Bölökbay gave him these,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l029","ordinal":179140,"en":"Brave Semey, son of Manas,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l030","ordinal":179141,"en":"Your lion who had studied the lesson, said:"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l031","ordinal":179142,"en":"“My ritual father Bölökbay,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l032","ordinal":179143,"en":"We should devote ourselves to you!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l033","ordinal":179144,"en":"My falcon father was a khan;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l034","ordinal":179145,"en":"Thinking the inheritance left by my father"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l035","ordinal":179146,"en":"Was gone when my father died,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l036","ordinal":179147,"en":"I find there is a man like my father!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l037","ordinal":179148,"en":"I have courage and fierce longing,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l038","ordinal":179149,"en":"And all my equipment is complete."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b003:l039","ordinal":179150,"en":"I may entrust myself to God;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l001","ordinal":179151,"en":"I will set right whoever attacks me!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l002","ordinal":179152,"en":"I will gird my waist firmly,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l003","ordinal":179153,"en":"And overthrow whoever I face."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l004","ordinal":179154,"en":"If fate arrives, I will die."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l005","ordinal":179155,"en":"Kongurbay is lord"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l006","ordinal":179156,"en":"Of heavenly Beijing city;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l007","ordinal":179157,"en":"I will wage fierce war"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l008","ordinal":179158,"en":"And thus avenge my father"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l009","ordinal":179159,"en":"Who departed this world!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l010","ordinal":179160,"en":"I will campaign against the khan;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l011","ordinal":179161,"en":"If Almighty Allah supports me,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l012","ordinal":179162,"en":"I will unleash a calamity"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l013","ordinal":179163,"en":"Upon the black-hearted Kalmyks."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l014","ordinal":179164,"en":"Without bringing slaughter and taking captives,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l015","ordinal":179165,"en":"Without spilling blood and taking revenge,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l016","ordinal":179166,"en":"I will not cease while any remain alive,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l017","ordinal":179167,"en":"Nor cease fighting for six months."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l018","ordinal":179168,"en":"Without learning the ground by scouting,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l019","ordinal":179169,"en":"Without raiding horses from Champang,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l020","ordinal":179170,"en":"How could I fail to fight"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l021","ordinal":179171,"en":"The warrior like a black mountain,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l022","ordinal":179172,"en":"Whose courage is high and venom strong,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l023","ordinal":179173,"en":"Who sets right whoever attacks him—"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l024","ordinal":179174,"en":"The wrathful infidel,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l025","ordinal":179175,"en":"Warrior Khan Kongurbay!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l026","ordinal":179176,"en":"If I do not take revenge, let me die;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l027","ordinal":179177,"en":"If I do not pursue my father's blood price,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l028","ordinal":179178,"en":"Let me sink childless!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l029","ordinal":179179,"en":"Against the Chinese, swollen like a bladder,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l030","ordinal":179180,"en":"I will wage fierce struggle."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l031","ordinal":179181,"en":"If my strength suffices against the infidel,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l032","ordinal":179182,"en":"I will subdue the Gün-zhang-zhung people,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l033","ordinal":179183,"en":"And inflict bitter grief."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l034","ordinal":179184,"en":"I will avenge Almambet,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l035","ordinal":179185,"en":"My beloved ritual father!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l036","ordinal":179186,"en":"The one I will fight is Kakan-Chyn;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l037","ordinal":179187,"en":"The one I lost is brave Chubak;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l038","ordinal":179188,"en":"The one I will war against is Kongurbay."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1348:b004:l039","ordinal":179189,"en":"I have continued the tale from tradition,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1349:b003:l001","ordinal":179190,"en":"And asked those who knew."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1349:b003:l002","ordinal":179191,"en":"The distant road takes six months;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1349:b003:l003","ordinal":179192,"en":"Until I return after six months,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1349:b003:l004","ordinal":179193,"en":"Farewell, my grieving people!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1349:b003:l005","ordinal":179194,"en":"I will travel outward for three months,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1349:b003:l006","ordinal":179195,"en":"And return for three months;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1349:b003:l007","ordinal":179196,"en":"I will come in the sixth month."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1349:b003:l008","ordinal":179197,"en":"If I do not come in the sixth month,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1349:b003:l009","ordinal":179198,"en":"Kakan-Chyn is the one I fight,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1349:b003:l010","ordinal":179199,"en":"And I will have perished and died!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1349:b003:l011","ordinal":179200,"en":"I am going to see"}]
